    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d242">

                <pb facs="0356" n="250" xml:id="pg250"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr.
                            Egan</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-12-03"><hi rendition="#italic">December 3,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Blaine instructs Mr. Egan to report who asked him for his testimony in the
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Baltimore</hi> case, which, according to telegraphic
                    advice received by the Chilean minister from the foreign office, was requested
                    of him twenty days ago and not given.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
